counterfactuals.output:
1. An image display system comprising:

a display device configured to display an image;

an operation input device configured to receive operation information corresponding to a user operation performed with respect to a display object displayed on the display device, the operation information including a movement direction and a movement amount of the user operation;

a storage device configured to store a plurality of display objects, each of the plurality of display objects being associated with one or more attribute parameters; and

one or more processors configured to:

display, on the display device, a first display object among the plurality of display objects;

acquire, from the operation input device, the operation information corresponding to the user operation performed with respect to the first display object;

identify, based on the movement direction and the movement amount included in the operation information, at least one attribute parameter to be changed relative to an attribute parameter of the first display object;

extract, from the plurality of display objects stored in the storage device, a second display object associated with an attribute parameter different from the attribute parameter of the first display object in accordance with the identified at least one attribute parameter; and

display, on the display device, the extracted second display object as a display object related to the first display object.
